---
import BlogPost from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<BlogPost
  title="Step-by-Step Application Roadmap"
  description="Follow these phases to apply for non-GKS funding in Korea."
  pubDate={new Date()}
>
  <main class="container">
    <h1>The No-GKS Application Roadmap</h1>
    <p>Follow these 4 phases sequentially to secure a fully funded degree in South Korea.</p>

    <div class="roadmap-grid">
      <div class="phase-card">
        <span class="step-num">Phase 1</span>
        <h2>Find Research Labs</h2>
        <p>Shortlist professors in your field at top STEM institutes (GIST, KAIST, UNIST) or SKY universities.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="phase-card">
        <span class="step-num">Phase 2</span>
        <h2>Cold-Emailing Professors</h2>
        <p>Craft tailored emails to PIs asking for research assistantship (RA) openings and monthly lab stipends.</p>
        <a href="/blog/how-to-cold-email-korean-professors-for-lab-funding">Read Email Guide & Template →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="phase-card">
        <span class="step-num">Phase 3</span>
        <h2>Official University Application</h2>
        <p>Once a professor agrees to sponsor you, submit your official university portal documents.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="phase-card">
        <span class="step-num">Phase 4</span>
        <h2>Visa & Arrival</h2>
        <p>Prepare your D-2 visa paperwork, health check, and dormitory registration.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BlogPost>